01:14:09.500 --> 01:14:10.500
Sakit.

01:16:00.708 --> 01:16:02.916
Mulai terasa gesekannya, ya.

01:16:06.791 --> 01:16:08.083
Sakit lagi.

01:16:23.791 --> 01:16:25.166
Kencang sekali.

01:16:35.500 --> 01:16:36.500
Sakit.

