01:38:50.000 --> 01:38:51.000
Iya.

01:40:32.875 --> 01:40:33.875
Duh.

01:40:43.416 --> 01:40:43.875
Ah.

01:40:44.500 --> 01:40:45.166
Hentikan.

01:40:45.500 --> 01:40:46.500
Iya.

01:40:46.666 --> 01:40:47.666
Duh.

01:40:54.291 --> 01:40:55.291
Iya.

