Aduh.

01:48:21.291 --> 01:48:22.291
Ah.

01:48:26.041 --> 01:48:26.708
Ah.

01:49:46.291 --> 01:49:47.291
Lalu kembali lagi.

01:49:57.875 --> 01:50:00.375
Lalu kembali lagi. Ini yang kedua.

01:50:05.000 --> 01:50:06.000
Lalu balik

01:50:14.083 --> 01:50:19.875
lagi ke sini.

01:51:05.958 --> 01:51:06.958
Menjijikkan.

01:51:14.333 --> 01:51:19.208
